increase retail space and municipal revenue Residents however feared that the new

4
00:00:15,829 --> 00:00:21,579
complex would displace small traders and weaken the neighbourhood's character Their objection

5
00:00:21,592 --> 00:00:26,724
was not simply an attachment to the past The market provided inexpensive

6
00:00:26,737 --> 00:00:32,342
food informal employment and a place where elderly residents could meet Its

7
00:00:32,355 --> 00:00:36,895
