8
00:00:37,803 --> 00:00:43,513
An architect suggested a more flexible option reinforce the structure improve drainage

9
00:00:43,737 --> 00:00:48,395
and convert the upper floor into a spacious community centre The plan

10
00:00:48,408 --> 00:00:52,934
would preserve the street's scale while improving its safety After a public

11
00:00:52,947 --> 00:00:57,724
forum the council agreed to assess both proposals It asked for a

12
00:00:57,737 --> 00:01:04,250
transparent account of cost environmental impact and the likelihood of disruption Urban

13
